    "attributes": {
        "action": "Reverse ban on puberty blockers for Under-18s",
        "additional_details": "Young people and their families should be able to make healthcare decisions with qualified clinicians based on individual clinical need and the best available evidence, not a blanket ban. We urge the Government to review the impact of the current restrictions on young people\u2019s wellbeing and restore access under appropriate clinical safeguards.",
        "background": "We call on the Government to reverse the ban on puberty blockers for under-18s when clinically appropriate.",
